flowchart TD
    %% Client Request Flow
    Client[Client MCP Request] --> Router{Router}
    Router -->|async=false| SyncPath[Sync Execution Path]
    Router -->|async=true| AsyncPath[Async Execution Path]
    
    %% Sync Path (Existing)
    SyncPath --> ChatTool[Chat Tool]
    SyncPath --> ConsensusTool[Consensus Tool]
    ChatTool --> Provider[Select Provider]
    ConsensusTool --> MultiProvider[Multiple Providers]
    Provider --> SyncResponse[Direct Response]
    MultiProvider --> SyncResponse
    SyncResponse --> Client
    
    %% Async Path (New)
    AsyncPath --> CreateJob[Create Job in AsyncJobStore]
    CreateJob --> ReturnJobID[Return continuation_id immediately]
    ReturnJobID --> Client
    CreateJob --> JobRunner[Submit to JobRunner]
    
    %% Background Execution
    JobRunner --> BackgroundExec[Background Execution]
    BackgroundExec --> StreamNorm[ProviderStreamNormalizer]
    StreamNorm --> OpenAIStream[OpenAI Streaming]
    StreamNorm --> GoogleStream[Google GenAI Streaming] 
    StreamNorm --> XAIStream[XAI Streaming]
    
    %% Progress Updates (Internal Only)
    OpenAIStream --> ProgressEvent[Progress Events]
    GoogleStream --> ProgressEvent
    XAIStream --> ProgressEvent
    ProgressEvent --> UpdateJobStore[Update AsyncJobStore]
    ProgressEvent --> WriteJournal[Write to FileCache Journal]
    ProgressEvent --> EventBus[Emit to EventBus - Internal Coordination]
    
    %% Completion Flow
    BackgroundExec --> JobComplete{Job Complete?}
    JobComplete -->|Success| WriteSnapshot[Write Final Snapshot]
    JobComplete -->|Error| WriteError[Write Error State]
    JobComplete -->|Partial Success| WritePartial[Write Partial Results]
    
    WriteSnapshot --> JobCompletionEvent[Job Completion Event]
    WriteError --> JobCompletionEvent
    WritePartial --> JobCompletionEvent
    JobCompletionEvent --> CleanupJob[Schedule Job Cleanup]
    
    %% Status Check Flow (Client Polling)
    Client -->|Polls via MCP| StatusCheck[check_status Tool]
    StatusCheck --> CheckMemory{Job in Memory?}
    CheckMemory -->|Yes| ReturnMemory[Return from AsyncJobStore]
    CheckMemory -->|No| CheckDisk[Check FileCache]
    CheckDisk --> ReturnDisk[Return from Snapshot]
    ReturnMemory --> StatusResponse[Status Response]
    ReturnDisk --> StatusResponse
    StatusResponse --> Client
    
    %% Cleanup Flow
    CleanupScheduler[Cleanup Scheduler] --> EvictMemory[Evict Expired Jobs from Memory]
    CleanupScheduler --> CleanDisk[Clean Old Files from Disk]
    EvictMemory --> AsyncJobStore
    CleanDisk --> FileCache
    
    %% Styling
    classDef existing fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b
    classDef new fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#4a148c
    classDef client fill:#e8f5e8,stroke:#2e7d32
    classDef storage fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ef6c00
    
    class Client,StatusResponse,SyncResponse client
    class ChatTool,ConsensusTool,Provider,MultiProvider existing
    class AsyncJobStore,JobRunner,EventBus,ProviderStreamNormalizer,FileCache new
    class WriteSnapshot,WriteJournal,WriteError storage